# DNS servers Faro can use, over HTTPS (encrypted: the network cannot read the
# names asked). One a line:  <side> <id> <address> <tls name> <label>
#
#   domestic  asked directly, for names that are in China (and for the addresses
#             of the proxy servers themselves)
#   foreign   asked THROUGH the proxy, for every other name, so that what is looked
#             up never leaves this Mac in the clear and is never answered by a
#             resolver inside China
#
# The addresses are IPs, so that no name has to be looked up to look names up.
# Each was tried before it was listed; one that stops answering is replaced here.
domestic alidns   223.5.5.5       dns.alidns.com          阿里 AliDNS
domestic dnspod   120.53.53.53    doh.pub                 腾讯 DNSPod
foreign  cloudflare 1.1.1.1       cloudflare-dns.com      Cloudflare
foreign  google   8.8.8.8         dns.google              Google
